THE VENUE

    The scene is a reality capture of a real stadium with permission from City of Denver. 
    Demo permission information available upon request by Esri.
    Nothing in the animated data names a club, and neither the painted 
    surfaces nor the player kit carries any team mark: team names,
     uniform designs and club marks are trademarks of their owners. 
    The playing surfaces are generated by the scripts in tools/.
